<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak cbank forex reserves firm to $3.02 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak cbank forex reserves firm to $3.02 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves totalled $3.021 billion as of July 9, up from $2.999 billion on July 2.</p>
<p>  SLOVAK FOREX RESERVES    July 9    July 2   Dec 31/96</p>
<p>   NBS reserves ($bln)     3.021	2.999     3.473</p>
<p>   Commercial banks	  2.622	2.778     2.321</p>
<p>   Entire banking sector   5.643	5.777     5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
